1) My feed was dominated by this X Money / Creator Coin thing. So naturally, an X addict like me, was curious. Everyone was talking about it. So I  replied jokingly to @StarPlatinum_  about it. See below.

2) Then all of a sudden everyone replied to my reply to say go on Pump Fun and take a look now. Ok...

3) To my surprise a coin was created of my handle. Ok silly but fun I guess. I originally posted a screenshot of it at $4k market cap and was like wtf I'm a memecoin now LOL. 

